#{ "file": "safety/shadow_simulator.py", "issue": "_check_change_rate 在被拒写入后仍把尝试值追加进 _history，重试同值 ratio=0 通过，10 倍跳变检测可被简单重试绕过；被拒值永久污染后续比率计算", "severity": "HIGH" },
#{ "file": "safety/validator.py", "issue": "_check_interlock_rules 中 float(value) 抛错时 return None，非数值类型（如 LLM 传入的字符串）绕过 max_value/min_value/cooldown 约束，仅 require_bits 仍执行；该路径经 orchestrator/core.py 可达", "severity": "HIGH" },
